026-10-26T06:30:51Z","value":5,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5151320","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5135440-1847286114031213","game_id":"steam-5135440","kind":"announcement","title":"DPS Developer Live Stream!","summary":"🎮 DPS: Desktop Pension Squad is LIVE!Join our developer live stream and get a sneak peek at DPS, an idle RPG that runs right on your desktop!⚔️ Watch your squad battle monsters automatically while you work, study, or browse.🖥️ Build your squad, grow stronger, and enjoy an RPG adventure right alongside your daily routine!🔥 The FREE DEMO is available now!Download the demo, experience DPS for yourself, and don't forget to add the game to your Steam Wishlist!Enjoy the stream and get ready for your n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T05:00:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031213","verified_at":"2026-10-22T07:54:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5135440-1846651706689194","game_id":"steam-5135440","kind":"announcement","title":"Wishlist & Share Steam Gift Card Giveaway","summary":"Hello!Thank you to everyone who participated in the Wishlist & Share event celebrating the launch of the DPS: Desktop Pension Squad store page.Following the draw, the 10 winners below have each won a ₩50,000 (KRW) Steam Digital Gift Card.Congratulations!■ Winners (last 4 digits of the 17-digit Steam ID shown)*************4321*************2723*************7828*************3397*************0503*************3038*************9580*************0723*************1716*************6501A video of the winne","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T08:06:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689194","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5135440-1846651706680887","game_id":"steam-5135440","kind":"announcement","title":"Official Discord Server Now Open!","summary":"Our Official Discord Server Is Open! Hello, this is the DPS:Desktop Pension Squad dev team! A huge thank you to everyone who played the demo and shared their thoughts with us. To stay closer to our players, we've opened our official Discord server! What you'll find thereLatest news – Be the first to see updates, patch notes, and Early Access news.Feedback & suggestions – Our dev team reads your feedback directly and uses it to shape the game.Bug reports – Found an issue while playing? Let us kno","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T10:23:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680887","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5135440-1846018067943726","game_id":"steam-5135440","kind":"update","title":"Demo Feedback Update & Connection Issue Fixed","summary":"Hello everyone! This is the DPS: Desktop Pension Squad dev team. Thank you so much for all the interest in our demo! Here's an update on the issues we've found so far and the feedback you've sent us about the demo. Access Restricted in Some CountriesSome players were unable to access the game in certain countries.This has now been fixed, and players in all countries can connect normally.We're sorry for the inconvenience. About Your Demo FeedbackWe're going through every piece of feedback you've ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T11:15:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943726","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5135440-1846018067940706","game_id":"steam-5135440","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log #4 — Making Chopper","summary":"After Diana, it's Chopper's turn. Here's the whole middle of the process: one jester, a pair of executioner's shears, and how he ended up looking the way he does. Who he is Chopper is a jester, and an executioner. He has done both jobs on the same stage, making people laugh and taking their heads, and he doesn't really see a difference between the two. His weapon is a pair of shears. Joined, they're one enormous pair of shears; split, they're two blades. When the shears change, so does the execu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T11:49:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940706","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5135440-1844751498231080","game_id":"steam-5135440","kind":"announcement","title":"Wishlist DPS, Share the Page, Win a Steam Gift Card!","summary":"Hello, everyone!The Steam store page for DPS: Desktop Pension Squad is now officially live.To celebrate, we're running a Wishlist & Share event.The event dates have been changed to align with Steam Next Fest, so we're sharing the updated details again.Every wishlist and every share means a lot to a team our size — thank you!Event Details & PrizesAdd DPS to your Steam wishlist and share the store page on social media or in your favorite gaming community.Winners will be drawn at random to receive ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T10:05:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498231080","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5135440-1844751498218420","game_id":"steam-5135440","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log #3 — Making Diana","summary":"After Mori & Gula, Diana. Here’s how one dark elf with a bow went from two arms to one, and from there to the character she is now.Who she isDiana used to be a marksman people knew by name. Then she lost an arm. When an archer loses an arm, the bow usually gets put down. Diana didn’t put it down. She called a wraith arm into the place where hers had been, took up the bow again, and is now a stronger shot than she ever was.So the heart of this character isn’t what she lost. It’s what came after. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T13:27:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218420","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5135440-1844115010491173","game_id":"steam-5135440","kind":"announcement","title":"Wishlist DPS, Share the Page, Win a Steam Gift Card! (Period Extended)","summary":"Hello, everyone!The Steam store page for DPS: Desktop Pension Squad is now officially live.To celebrate, we're running a Wishlist & Share event.Every wishlist and every share means a lot to a team our size — thank you!Event Details & PrizesAdd DPS to your Steam wishlist and share the store page on social media or in your favorite gaming community.Winners will be drawn at random to receive a Steam Digital Gift Card.10 winners: Steam Digital Gift Card ₩50,000 (approx. USD $36)Event Period & Winner","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T07:41:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010491173","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5135440-1843481262701067","game_id":"steam-5135440","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log #2 — Making Mori & Gula","summary":"Last time we promised the shy lich and the hungry staff. Here they are, and here's how they went from a page of horned doodles to the character in the game.Who they areMori is a lich. Not the tower-of-skulls, end-of-the-campaign kind. She's the kind who got the title before she was ready for it. She keeps her eyes hidden behind her bangs, flinches at loud noises, and would honestly prefer that the humans invading the dungeon just went home.Gula is her staff. Gula has opinions. Gula has an appeti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T08:47:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701067","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5135440-1842846814439675","game_id":"steam-5135440","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log #1 — Skills That Wait for a Reason","summary":"One thing before we start: the system described in this log is locked. The individual skills, their trigger conditions, and their names are not — they will keep shifting while we tune the game. Please read every example here as a snapshot of where we are today, not a promise of the final version.We're making DPS: a desktop idle game where you run the dungeon, and adventurers come to die in it. Three creatures, one lane, no buttons. Combat runs on its own while you do something else.Which raises ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T09:00:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814439675","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5135440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:03Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:03Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"s